    "name": "Ludus Manager",
    "steam_appid": 3756180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756180/extras/eb3ed67bfa721b9701518e44de5f5740.avif?t=1751602408\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS LUDUS?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to manage a <i>ludus</i> in the ancient Roman Empire? I can almost hear you asking, \u201cWhat\u2019s a ludus anyway?\u201d A ludus is what they called the schools that trained gladiators for the people\u2019s favorite event\u2014gladiator fights. And you\u2019re very close to running one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your gladiator, set up your camp, and dominate fights across different cities in the Roman Empire. Shape your story based on the character you choose. Make different choices in dialogues to determine your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, gather intel from rival luduses and choose your gladiator accordingly. Craft new items for your fighters, or brew potions to boost their strength. Manage your ludus however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how well you manage it, sometimes things happen out of the blue. Fate... So watch out for random events that may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to casually manage a <i>ludus</i> in the ancient Roman Empire, this game is just for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756180/extras/eb3ed67bfa721b9701518e44de5f5740.avif?t=1751602408\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS LUDUS?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to manage a <i>ludus</i> in the ancient Roman Empire? I can almost hear you asking, \u201cWhat\u2019s a ludus anyway?\u201d A ludus is what they called the schools that trained gladiators for the people\u2019s favorite event\u2014gladiator fights. And you\u2019re very close to running one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your gladiator, set up your camp, and dominate fights across different cities in the Roman Empire. Shape your story based on the character you choose. Make different choices in dialogues to determine your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, gather intel from rival luduses and choose your gladiator accordingly. Craft new items for your fighters, or brew potions to boost their strength. Manage your ludus however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how well you manage it, sometimes things happen out of the blue. Fate... So watch out for random events that may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to casually manage a <i>ludus</i> in the ancient Roman Empire, this game is just for you.</p>",
